### CREATE — validation failures (expect 422)
### ============================================================

###

### Both cron and date triggers supplied → 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/schedules/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "Bad trigger",
  "trigger": {
    "cron": {"fields": {"hour": "9"}},
    "date": "2030-01-01T09:00:00+00:00"
  },
  "properties": {
    "target_type": "chat_completion",
    "url": "https://core.dial/openai/deployments/gpt-4o/chat/completions"
  }
}

###

### No trigger supplied → 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/schedules/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "display_name": "No trigger",
  "trigger": {},
  "properties": {
    "target_type": "chat_completion",
    "url": "https://core.dial/openai/deployments/gpt-4o/chat/completions"
  }
}

###

